          "text": "Is that okay?",
          "range": {
            "start": 67,
            "end": 80
          },
          "chunks": [
            "Is that okay?"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "w5-line-04",
      "lines": [
        3
      ],
      "speaker": "Physio",
      "text": "Based on what you've told me and what I've found during the assessment,",
      "chunks": [
        "Based on what you've told me and what I've found",
        "during the assessment,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "w5-line-05",
      "lines": [
        4
      ],
      "speaker": "Physio",
      "text": "it seems that your back has become quite sensitive to certain movements and activities.",
      "chunks": [
        "it seems that your back has become quite sensitive",
        "to certain movements and activities."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "w5-line-06",
      "lines": [
        5
      ],
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Yeah, even simple things like putting my shoes on can be uncomfortable.",
      "chunks": [
        "Yeah, even simple things like putting my shoes on",
        "can be uncomfortable."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "w5-line-07",
      "lines": [
        6
      ],
      "speaker": "Physio",
      "text": "I understand. Sometimes, when you've had pain for a while, your body can become a bit more protective.",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "I understand.",
          "range": {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 13
          },
          "chunks": [
            "I understand."
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sometimes, when you've had pain for a while, your body can become a bit more protective.",
          "range": {
            "start": 14,
            "end": 102
          },
          "chunks": [
            "Sometimes, when you've had pain for a while,",
            "your body can become a bit more protective."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "w5-line-09",
      "lines": [
        8
      ],
      "speaker": "Physio",
      "text": "Its job is to warn you about danger, but sometimes it can go off even when there's no real danger.",
      "chunks": [
        "Its job is to warn you about danger, but sometimes it can go off",
        "even when there's no real danger."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "w5-line-10",
      "lines": [
        9
      ],
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "So, does that mean I've damaged something in my back?",
      "chunks": [
        "So, does that mean",
        "I've damaged something in my back?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "w5-line-12",
      "lines": [
        11
      ],
      "speaker": "Physio",
      "text": "Sometimes, your body is just being extra careful and sending out pain signals more easily than usual.",
      "chunks": [
        "Sometimes, your body is just being extra careful",
        "and sending out pain signals",
        "more easily than usual."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "w5-line-15",
      "lines": [
        14
      ],
      "speaker": "Physio",
      "text": "I haven't identified anything that immediately suggests a serious problem.",
      "chunks": [
        "I haven't identified anything",
        "that immediately suggests a serious problem."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "w5-line-18",
      "lines": [
        17
      ],
      "speaker": "Physio",
      "text": "We can start by finding movements that feel comfortable for you and gradually build things up.",
      "chunks": [
        "We can start by finding movements",
        "that feel comfortable for you",
        "and gradually build things up."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "w5-line-19",
      "lines": [
        18
      ],
      "speaker": "Physio",
      "text": "The aim is to help your back feel more comfortable with movement again.",
      "chunks": [
        "The aim is to help your back",
        "feel more comfortable with movement again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "w5-line-21",
      "lines": [
        20
      ],
      "speaker": "Physio",
      "text": "Absolutely. We'll work towards that together, one step at a time.",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Absolutely.",
          "range": {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 11
          },
          "chunks": [
            "Absolutely."
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We'll work towards that together, one step at a time.",
          "range": {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 65
          },
          "chunks": [
            "We'll work towards that together,",
            "one step at a time."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "w5-line-23",
      "lines": [
        22
      ],
      "speaker": "Physio",
      "text": "No worries. Do you have any other questions about what we've discussed?",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "No worries.",
